=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note:}** You must wait up to 1 minute after the completion of the previous quest.
* Talk with {n:Enaremand} (J-7).
* Talk to {n:Chemioue} (J-6).
** If you haven't done {q:Petals for Parelbriaux|Petals for Parelbriaux|Petals for Parelbriaux}, and are at Promathia Mission 3-5 or later, you may get that cut-scene first.
* Go to {z:Phomiuna Aqueducts}, find a Wooden Ladder at C-9 on the second map, and climb the ladder for a cut-scene.
* Go to {z:Misareaux Coast} and select the **???** at I-6 near the end of the river for the {@k}{k:Mire incense}.
* Go to the base of the waterfall at F-4 in {z:Misareaux Coast} and select the **???** for a cut-scene.
* Select the **???** again to spawn the mannequin {p:NM} {m:Alsha}.
** The NM can cast {p:Silence}, {s:Paralyze}, and will occasionally cast {s:Cure III} on you.
** Once she is reduced to around 20%, and {m:Alsha} will repeatedly cast {p:Fire II} on herself until she dies.
*** If she kills herself, you will have to rezone and try to kill her again; you must deal the final blow to defeat her.
* Once {m:Alsha} is defeated, select the **???** again to obtain {@k}{k:Better Humes and Mannequins}.
* Travel to {z:Mhaura} and talk to {n:Fyi Chalmwoh} who will take the key item then allow you to pose your mannequins for 200 {p:Gil}.

